{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Do something in Real Life for once!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real Life is a firstperson shooter set in the semi-open world of Reality. Go from planet to planet, ruining lives, stealing weapons and doing whatever the head tells you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">__________________________________________</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>KILL everyone and take their money!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756310/extras/money.jpg?t=1746472325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Dodge attacks by using the advanced movement options provided to the Blenderman!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756310/extras/gif3.gif?t=1746472325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Block enemy attacks and send back the damage with the parry!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756310/extras/gif1.gif?t=1746472325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Customize the Blenderman with new colors and awesome hats!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756310/extras/hats.jpg?t=1746472325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Explore strange new worlds and talk to weird aliens.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756310/extras/talkTOAliens.jpg?t=1746472325\" /></p><p class=\